  "scope": "Old Wing On historic building at 635 Nanjing Road: six-storey main body, photo-visible local seventh storey, northeast curved entrance and a separate rooftop tower on the western part of the northern frontage. New Wing On at 627, connecting bridges and neighboring buildings excluded.",
