  },
  "measurements_policy": "Official six storeys locally seven, two-storey rooftop tower, site area 5681.5 square metres and gross floor area 30992.3 square metres do not establish width, depth or exact height. The frozen derived map has a 94.636 by 66.671 metre minimum bounding rectangle, with no height, floors, holes or linked parts; not a surveyed wall outline.",
